rong communication/teamwork for Candidate\u202fA (or for another candidate) that outweighs the current negatives, or any additional serious flaw for A (e.g., documented crew\u2011conflict incidents).\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate A\"}"}
